 DEFINITIONS
     INP_PHASE=TIME FOR INPUT PHASE
     STF_PHASE=TIME FOR CALCULATION OF STRUCTURE STIFFNESS MATRIX
     REN_PHASE=TIME FOR INTEL SPARSE REORDERING EQUATIONS
     DEC_PHASE=TIME FOR INTEL SPARSE (LDL DECOMPOSITION)
